  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Incorrect free in pcre2_jit_match() when a match\n     data block that held a copied subject from an earlier pcre2_match()\n     call with PCRE2_COPY_MATCHED_SUBJECT was reused, because the JIT fast\n     path overwrote the subject without releasing the copy\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-89161.patch: free a previously copied\n       subject in src/pcre2_jit_match.c, with pcre2test handling and test\n       coverage in testdata/testinput17 and testdata/testoutput17\n     - CVE-2026-89161",
